      "prompt": "Create one abstract logo for TIDE. Exact text (copy verbatim, no other words): ''. Exact slogan: ''.\nRender only the supplied exact text and nonempty slogan; the brand context is not additional lettering. Empty strings request no corresponding text.\nIndustry: Team scheduling and shift coordination SaaS. Audience: Operations coordinators and teammates in teams of 5–30 people.\nStyles: calm, geometric, flat. Original brief palette context: #2357A5, #C1DCE3, #FFFFFF.\nAvoid: lettering or initials, literal waves, clock, calendar, infinity sign. Use cases: 32px web-app sidebar symbol, service landing page.\nBackground: opaque. Produce a real PNG raster image. Use clean, readable shapes at small sizes; leave safe margins. Do not draw a transparency checkerboard, mockup, watermarks, or a concept grid.\nConcept direction: A team scheduling service makes handoffs feel coordinated: two substantial offset forms meet through a single clear interval, with consistent curve weight and an open central gap. Keep the asymmetry of the handoff readable at 32px without resembling waves, a clock, a calendar, an infinity sign or a letter. Use quiet-technology blue #2357A5 for the dominant form and pale cyan #C1DCE3 for a smaller supporting form; the blue silhouette must carry the idea. Use flat color with no dimensional lighting. Keep generous exterior space on an opaque #FFFFFF canvas, including empty corners and margins, with no cream tint, paper texture, gradient, vignette or exterior shadow. Risk to inspect: the pale supporting form may disappear at 32px or the join may look like a generic chain link.. Assumptions: Fictional matched comparison brief; one concept requested; assistant chooses colors within the stated background request.\nLogo construction: Build a nonliteral abstract mark around the concept's geometric or organic gesture, with coherent weight, deliberate openings and a memorable silhouette. Use style references for broad construction traits, not their brand words or traced signature shapes. The identity should remain recognizable in a one-color silhouette at the intended use size. This construction check does not replace the requested palette or request an extra monochrome image.\nEffective structured palette intent (authoritative over historical palette): {\"swatches\":[{\"hex\":\"#2357A5\",\"role\":\"dominant abstract handoff form\"},{\"hex\":\"#C1DCE3\",\"role\":\"smaller supporting abstract form\"},{\"hex\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"role\":\"explicitly requested opaque white exterior canvas\"}],\"constraints\":{\"locked_hex\":[],\"allowed_hex\":null,\"max_colors\":null,\"required_hex\":[],\"allow_gradients\":false},\"source\":\"assistant\",\"source_evidence\":{\"reference_id\":null,\"reference_sha256\":null,\"provider\":null,\"tool\":null,\"response\":null,\"notes\":[\"Uses the existing Quiet technology primary and pale companion suggestion; omits the lettering color because the user requests no text. White exterior follows the explicit brief. These are proposed values, not sampled colors.\"]},\"selected_by\":\"assistant\",\"rationale\":\"A restrained blue dominant mark with a pale cyan supporting form fits a calm coordination service; role hierarchy is to be visually checked at 32px.\",\"calculation_version\":\"logo-color-v1\",\"id\":\"advisory-v1\",\"parent_palette_id\":null,\"digest\":\"dcbfdc13f7d0c1fd0bb7c4fa97b98a68586dfbb0a7bdff1bbbb23dc6987bab0b\"}. Keep locked and required HEX values exactly in intent; use the declared roles and allowed colors/count. Opaque backgrounds count as visible design colors; transparent pixels do not. No gradients unless allowed. Raster fidelity is measured after generation, never promised as exact pixels.\nLettering fidelity: preserve every Unicode character, capitalization, punctuation, space and reading order in the applicable text. Keep Hangul syllable blocks intact; do not translate, romanize, abbreviate or substitute lookalike glyphs. Shape changes must keep required text readable, including counters and joins at the intended size.\n",
